window.products.push({"id":329110,"name":"AIEVE 200 Pcs Air Fryer Liners Disposable for XL Air Fryer Ovens, 11x12 inches Nonstick Parchment Paper Air Fryer Accessories for Ninja Foodi Air Frye","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A1xAHglkL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The air fryer oven parchment paper sheets for XL air fryer oven made of selected natural pulp, oil-proof, waterproof, non-fluorescent, non-bleaching and chlorine-free. You can safely use airfryer liners with air fryer oven to make delicious food. You can use air fryer liners disposable with toaster oven to make a variety of delicious meals. These parchment paper for baking with non-stick feature can effectively prevent the oven from staining stains and help you easily complete the cleaning work. The perforated design of the air fryer oven liner is specially made for air fryer. Enough holes will not affect the heat transfer of the air fryer, and parchment paper sheets are also conducive to the steam circulation of the dehydrator. AIEVE unbleached parchment paper perfect compatibility with Ninja air fryer oven, Ninja Foodi air fryer max xl, Ninja SP101 digital air fry, Ninja SP201 digital air fry pro, Ninja SP301 Foodi smart dual heat air fry, Ninja DT201 Foodi xl pro air fry, Ninja DT251 Foodi smart xl air fry oven, cosori air fryer, instant pot air fryer and most XL air fryer ovens. You can also cut and use these air fryer oven accessories according to the size of the air fryer basket. Tips: Before you preheat the air fryer toaster oven, put enough food on top of the parchment paper liners to prevent the parchment paper from flying away and being burned by the heating element!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A1xAHglkL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AIEVE","source_asin":"B097CXHLPD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-329110","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097CXHLPD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097CXHLPD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":329111,"name":"Font World Map IV by Michael Tompsett, 18x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":51.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iVsfG57LL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery wrapped art piece features a font world map. Art and design were always Michael's favorite subjects at school. He was fortunate to land a job as a graphic designer at one of London's most prestigious publishing companies. After 12 years Michael Topsett made the decision to pursue a full-time career creating his own work. The freedom and time to be able to focus solely on his own projects has been a wonderful experience. Athrough Michael likes to experiment with different styles and subjects, hi main focus is on map art. He enjoys looking for unique and interesting ways to depict something which is very familiar. Maps are visual representations of the world we live in, a world which is incredibly diverse. Apart from maps, Tompsett creates urban landmark and cityscape designs.  Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iVsfG57LL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00BKJWBLQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-329111","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BKJWBLQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BKJWBLQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
