window.products.push({"id":329380,"name":"KeKaBox Whimsical Iridescent Holographic Acrylic Floating Picture Frame, Magnetic Closure - Displays Photo up to 4x6 (Value Pack of 2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819rqp6UavL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Who said scrapbooking couldn’t be done in a picture frame? Let your creative juice flow, and memories float, in this unique block of frozen rainbow! ★ A freestanding photo frame made with quality high clarity acrylic of a substantial presence —in two panels securely held together by tiny but mighty magnetic clasps at the corners.★ Translucent iridescent finish reflects mystical unicorn colors at different angles.★ One frame, many possibilities ~    ✪ Houses photographs/instant film, printed media/postcard, or artwork .    ✪ Option of multi-photo display by arranging smaller memorabilia side by side.★ Acrylic shares the transparent and light transmitting properties of glass, but is shatter-resistant and of higher impact strength .★ Unlike traditional picture frames, the convenient magnetic fastening means you can easily swap photos or adjust your design in seconds .★ Makes an enchanting touch to your desk, or a unique gift for a friend/a new mom/a graduating senior.★ Value pack of 2 frames . Hugs photo(s) and memorabilia up to 4 x 6 inches—you decide how much of the “rainbow” glistens through!★ Product dimensions: Approx. 5.0 W x 7.0 H x 0.8 D inches. Also available in clear.★ Caring instructions: Insert photo with gloves to avoid smudges. Clean frame with warm soapy water and a soft, lint-free cloth if needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819rqp6UavL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KeKaBox","source_asin":"B07G321KLT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-329380","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G321KLT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G321KLT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":329381,"name":"Piper Classics Harmony Throw Pillow Cover w/ 5\" Side Ruffle, 18\" L x 18\" W, Farmhouse, Boho, Vintage Chenille Bedding, Off White Diamond Pattern","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BOeOTkpUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"One pillow cover per package. Fits one 18\"L x 18\"W, not included, Trimmed with a 5″ self-gathered ruffle. Visit our Piper Classics Store to find coordinating items to complete your ensemble (see link under product name). Beautifully diamond designed fabric reverses to a plain textured fabric. A single layered 5\" ruffle on the left side of sham hides 2 fabric ties. 100% richly-textured & tufted cotton (single layer) in a tone on tone white. Thick woven yarn that features raised threads and slight knots, known as slubs. Diamond designs are created in a tone-on-tone color scheme with tufts of woven yarn in a thick, plush pile. These tufts are often called chenille. We recommend dry cleaning to prevent shrinkage (test small area first). Or, machine wash separately in front load commercial washer, cold water, gentle cycle. No chlorine bleach, do not tumble dry, air fluff or line dry, iron if needed. The sham is richly textured, giving it a soft, cozy hand-feel, and the overall white tones have a refreshing visual depth and textural interest. A lush geometric design of large diamonds with circles and smaller diamonds tucked inside. A single-layered 5″ plain-cotton ruffle graces the left side of the pillow sham hiding fabric ties and adding layers of graceful softness to your bedding. Layer with other bedding and linens in the Harmony Collection to create the designer bedroom of your dreams.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BOeOTkpUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Piper Classics","source_asin":"B09P4BQX5V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-329381","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P4BQX5V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P4BQX5V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
