window.products.push({"id":329514,"name":"OPAWZ Permanent Dog Hair Dye, Pet Hair Dye Safely Used by Grooming Salons for a Decade, Pet Safe Dye Lasts Over 20 Washes, Bright Color for Dogs and H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HlKsLsFyL._AC_SL1349_.jpg","description":"Permanent Color lasts for more than 20 washes. For creative grooming competition and professional groomers use. Long-lasting permanent color specially formulated for dog and horse. Provides bright, fashionable and unique color results. Can be used on white, grey, apricot, and brown coats. Coloring results may vary with coat type and breed. You may refer to the OPAWZ label for coloring results. Non-toxic and gentle on pet's coat. All the colors can be mixed with each other according to your own preference. Directions: Shampoo and blow-dry first if the dog's coat is dirty and oily. Shake well before opening. Apply onto desired coat area and leave it on for 20 minutes (For the Loyal Brown and Vital Copper, please let the color sit on the hair for at least 40 minutes). Rinse and dry after. Note: Be sure to stir well with a brush before use. And for coloring limited areas, such as ears or tails, you may apply to dry fur. Results may vary depending on application strength and individual pet’s coat. Coloring results may vary with coat type and breed. Do not use any conditioner or applied other brands' dye may contain conditioner before using OPAWZ dye. CAUTION: Not recommended for use on pets under 6 months. Don't ​use on cats. Don't use on pets with sensitive, irritated, or damaged skin. Don't allow pets to lick. Avoid contact with eyes and mouth. If it happens, rinse with a large amount of water for 15 minutes. If any allergic reactions happen during dyeing, discontinue process immediately and consult a veterinarian. Allergy test on the skin is recommended 48 hours prior to application if the pet is being colored for the first time","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HlKsLsFyL._AC_SL1349_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OPAWZ","source_asin":"B09QLDGYG3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-329514","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QLDGYG3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QLDGYG3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
