window.products.push({"id":329725,"name":"Topline Expandable 2-Tier Shoe Rack Organizer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DiwE4W9cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Topline 2-Tier Expandable Shelf Shoe Rack Tower Storage Organizer – Silver- Practical and Functional: Perfect for your everyday shoe storing needs. Its portability is very convenient when you want to move your shoes around, and the disassembly and assembly is uncomplicated and simple. - Easy Cleaning and Maintaining: Simply use a damp cloth to clean the shoe rack.- Sturdy and Reliable: The frame is made from high-quality metal, so its strong enough to handle whatever shoes you choose to storeAbout Topline: - Our mission at Topline is to create a comfortable, healthy, clean, and serene home environment through rigorous product design and development.- We strive to complement a home’s natural comforts with home-goods that elevate quality of life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DiwE4W9cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Topline","source_asin":"B07GZ3RSYJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-329725","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GZ3RSYJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GZ3RSYJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":329726,"name":"Lahome Banana Leaf Shower Curtain - Tropical Green Leaves Polyester Waterproof Fabric Shower Curtain Set for Bathroom Decorations with Hooks (Banana L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91iayrqKd4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Shower curtains are an essential element to any bathroom with a tub or shower stall. Whether you wish to update the look of your decor or simply want something reliable to repel moisture and also keep water off your bathroom tile, the ideal shower curtain should be both functional and attractive. Lahome shower curtains are the perfect choice. Features: -Made of 100% heavyweight polyester fabric with Eco-Friendly, which will not only last multiple wash cycles but also provide an elegant environment for you. - The brightly colored digitally printed on the curtain add a fantastic flair to an ordinary space, and you can use this versatile curtain for bathtubs and showers alike. - Lahome shower curtains promotes water bead formation and is made to withstand damp, moisture rich bathroom environments; Drapes beautifully for a clean fresh look in your bathroom and has a soft hand feel. - Easy to care for and safe to machine wash cold in a mesh laundry bag, gentle cycle and tumble dry low. - Package : One Shower curtain 72 by 72 Inches; 12 C-shaped hooks included. Exude boldness in your bathroom decor by hanging this gorgeous shower curtain from Lahome. Buy it now. Note 1.The digital images on our website are as accurate as possible. Due to differences in computer monitors, some rug colors may vary slightly. 2.Lengths and widths may vary from the published dimensions. We do our best to provide you with an exact measurement, but please be advised that some variation exists.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91iayrqKd4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lahome","source_asin":"B07RQKQYYW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-329726","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RQKQYYW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RQKQYYW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":329727,"name":"QB Kraftz Clear Ice Ball Maker - Slow Melting Clear Sphere Ice Cube Maker | Get Ice Made Clear for Cocktail Drinks | Clear Ice Mold Makes Large Clear ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XUHcuOEXS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"QBKRAFTZ CLEAR ICE MAKER FOR CHILLING COCKTAILS - Get every bartender's secret weapon for cocktail-quality, crystal clear ice cubes with the QB Kraftz clear ice cube mold. QB Kraftz's patented technology includes thick insulation that keeps smells and odors from ruining your drink. Best of all, with this crystal clear ice maker's directional freezing insulated tray, air-bubbles are pushed to the bottom, ensuring slow melting, perfectly clear ice balls, every time. No more cloudy ice cubes. CLEAR ICE BALL MAKER WITH MULTIPLE SHAPES AVAILABLE - Give your drinks and cocktails that extra sparkle with the QB Kraftz clear ice cube tray. Our portable ice maker with clear ice system is designed to be interchangeable and removable for easy cleaning. Switch out the 2 large clear ball molds with up to 13 other molds (sold separately) and enjoy fun, crystal ice in the comfort of your own home. The novelty mini ice maker and clear ice ball mold for every occasion. EASY TO USE CLEAR ICE SPHERE MAKER - To make your ice clear using our clear sphere ice mold, first, boil and cool your filtered water. Fill the selected clear molds with water. Press together and place the QB Kraftz crystal clear ice mold into the freezer. Once frozen, simply disassemble the clear sphere mold and pop out your clear ice molds! For added convenience, the bottom reservoir fills with regular ice cubes so that no ice goes to waste. Use for regular cocktails or fruit smoothies. CRYSTAL CLEAR ICE CUBE MAKER WITH STACKING FUNCTION - The QB Kraftz directional freezing ice cube tray has a unique stacking function, which allows for multiple ice trays to be stacked for easy water filling and space-saving freezing. Combine your favorite molds and freeze multiple crystal ice cubes in a single pour. The perfect crystal ice ball maker for parties, bars, restaurants, and holiday entertaining. For stacking ability, you will need to purchase 2 sets of clear ice cube trays. MORE THAN JUST A CRYSTAL CLEAR ICE BALL MAKER - The QB Kraftz large clear ice cube maker is amazingly versatile, allowing you to freeze dairy or dairy substitutes to take your drinks to new levels. Freeze everything from small berries and fruit to almond milk and cream. The ideal clear ice kit for cocktail and neat whiskey drinkers. When you have clear large balls created by our tray, you will also have less water in your drink over time, making it taste better for longer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XUHcuOEXS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QB KRAFTZ","source_asin":"B097H795J8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-329727","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097H795J8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097H795J8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
