window.products.push({"id":329735,"name":"Unbreakable Stemless Champagne Flutes 9oz Set of 4, Shatterproof Tritan Plastic Glasses, Reusable Dishwasher Safe Flute, Wedding, Bachelorette, Travel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713B7F8xFcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Stemless Plastic Champagne Glasses: Durability of Tritan and beauty of glass all in one. Serve a mimosa or prosecco in these premium unbreakable champagne flutes and guests won't know the difference. Product Care: TaZa glasses have a barely visible seam that does not interfere with quality/function of the product. At a width of 1.25\", this flute has a dainty opening that preserves bubbles. Do not use harsh scrubbers on glass. Frequent/extended contact with essential oils, like those found in certain sunscreens, may cause glass to get cloudy. Hand wash with warm water and soap as soon as possible to avoid this. TaZa glasses are dishwasher safe on the top rack, warm setting. Impeccable Champagne Flute Glass Set: Premium quality flutes. Unlike lesser plastic champagne glasses or an acrylic champagne flute, TaZa's unbreakable champagne flutes are 100% USA-made Tritan. They're BPA-free, EA-free, and more scratch and warp-resistant than any other acrylic champagne glasses. Plus, they are dishwasher safe! Versatile Stemless Champagne Glasses: Need bachelorette mimosa glasses? New Years champagne cups? These shatterproof outdoor glasses are perfect for bridal events, toasting, the beach, holiday, hot tub, and more. All your party needs, covered. Family-Friendly: Serve your kids juice in these baby-proof glasses and never fret about having them drop and break it. These unbreakable premium drinking glasses make for excellent kitchen and patio glasses. Enjoy The Moment: Whether you're drinking in the hot tub, camping, sailing, or just in your patio or backyard, these stemless champagne flutes help you maximize fun and minimize worry. You'll never have to deal with a broken flute ruining a good time. If you're up for an adventure and a good time, this reusable plastic champagne flute set are just what you need.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713B7F8xFcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TaZa","source_asin":"B0B4MVPYMY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-329735","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4MVPYMY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4MVPYMY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":329736,"name":"GroundLuxe Organic Fitted Grounding Sheet - for King Size Bed - Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":189.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rZQCwlE-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Soft, high-quality 400 thread count fitted sheet made of certified organic cotton for maximum comfort and wellness. This durable and washable fabric is well-suited to long term use. The sheet can accommodate mattresses up to 13 inches (33 cm) in depth The organic cotton sheet is woven with highly conductive silver fiber in a tight pattern that guarantees contact throughout the night. The silver fiber is highly conductive and durable yet not noticeable to the touch, you won't be aware that it is there The sheet also comes with a 15 foot (4.6 meter) universal grounding cord that plugs into the grounding port of a standard electrical outlet. This sheet uses NO electricity, as the cord plugs into the grounding port (round hole below the 2 slots) only Each sheet is tested for quality but we encourage you to test your sheet with a multimeter and instructions are included that clearly explain how to test each part of the grounding sheet. Your satisfaction is 100% guaranteed, so please contact us with any questions and we will help you troubleshoot, though the sheets are very simple to install and use A number of studies have shown benefits from using grounding products, though it can take up to 30 days of consistent use to notice the effects. Fitted sheets are an optimal grounding solution because they stay in place and in contact with you, and they work while you sleep","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rZQCwlE-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GroundLuxe","source_asin":"B07RL3F73Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-329736","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RL3F73Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RL3F73Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
