window.products.push({"id":329756,"name":"Dasupril Bed Headboard Stoppers for Wall 3PCS - Adjustable Bed Frame Anti-Shake Tool - Headboard Stabilizer - Bed Noise Stopper, Easy Install (40-55mm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61P3MlWCLEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☝️[ ENJOY SLEEPING ] - These bed stoppers keep the headboard stable, and your bed will never make noise while you sleep so that you can sleep soundly and quietly. ✌️[ VARIOUS USE ] - Do you often feel anxious about the noise of your bed, bookshelf, cupboard, chair, sofa, refrigerator, or washing machine? If they are always shaking, our bed stoppers will be a perfect choice, your package includes 3PCS that together will achieve a noise-free home for you. 👌[ WALL PROTECTION & EASY TO INSTALL] - The EVA pad of the bed stabilizer against wall effectively reduces noise and protects your wall from damage. Measure the distance between your shaking furniture and the wall, Then select the appropriate size headboard stopper clockwise/counterclockwise(1.57\"-2.17\"/40-55mm). 👍[Practical Patent Design] - This is a headboard stabilizer with multiple US utility & appearance patents, which is heavy-duty. Made of high-density molecular materials, suitable for all furniture. ✋[ BEST AFTER-SALES SERVICE ] We have the most perfect after-sale service, if you don't completely like our product after receiving it, you will get your money back.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61P3MlWCLEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dasupril","source_asin":"B09TSBQPNR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-329756","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TSBQPNR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TSBQPNR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
