window.products.push({"id":329760,"name":"JSYMJSY 6pcs/10inch Unbreakable Deep Plate, Wheat Straw Plates Set with Loofah-Dish-Brush, Lightweight Plastic Plate Reusable, Camping Plate, Dishwash","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DeCH-GnrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌾 ECO-FRIENDLY & FOOD SAFE: The premium wheat straw deep plates are mainly made of natural wheat straw fibers, which will not break and have a slight straw fragrance. they do not contain BPA ingredients, not only can fully ensure a healthy diet for the whole family, but also promote the sustainable development of the ecological environment. Its unbreakable properties can also ensure that no debris will be generated when falling, ensuring the safety of adults and children. 🌾 USE VALUE MAXIMIZATION: For those who often host parties, these nifty wheat straw dinner plates save space, stackable shape and almost unbreakable design that completely replace disposable paper dinner plates and fragile ceramic plates. Designed with smooth round edges, deep enough for snack, cake, salad, pasta. With large size and attractive colors, they can be popular at BBQ, swimming pool, RV, wedding, picnic and camping, providing convenient services for your life. 🌾 LIGHTWEIGHT & PORTABLE: These unbreakable wheat straw plates are made of enough and high-quality materials and are thicker than similar plates, which ensures a strong and durable product. At the same time, they are very light, weighing only about 100 grams each, which is very practical for children and elderly people who cannot lift heavy objects. The lightweight design prevents unbearable scratching sound when moving and placing, so you can always maintain polite and elegant dining. 🌾 EFFORTLESS HEATING & CLEANING: These plastic plates reusable have a maximum heat resistance of 248°F (120°C) and can be heated in the microwave for 3 minutes. Most foods will heat up quickly within this time. Not too hot when you take it out of the microwave. Simply put them in the dishwasher after use. You can also use the matching kitchen loofah sponge to clean it to prolong its lifespan. 🌾 FIRST CHOICE FOR KITCHENS & GIFTS: These lightweight wheat straw fiber plates can be stacked together for storage, saving kitchen space and solving storage problems for you. The large size is also the first choice for dinner and buffet, as well as children's plate for birthday. Comfortable color matching and environmentally friendly packaging boxes make it the best gift choice for housewarming, weddings, Thanksgiving and Christmas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DeCH-GnrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JSYMJSY","source_asin":"B0B4511YQP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-329760","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4511YQP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4511YQP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
