window.products.push({"id":329763,"name":"Sijo Premium Stone Washed 100% French Linen Duvet Cover, Small Batch Sourced from Normandy, Breathable and Durable (Snow, Full/Queen)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":225.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616MeyBBFVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Awarded as \"The Softest Linen Sheets of 2022\" by Sleep Foundation. Also Featured in ‘Forbes’, ‘Vogue’, 'GQ', ‘Well+Good’, ‘Cosmopolitan’, and ‘Fast Company’ etc. \"Sijo French flax linen has a higher fabric density than most other brands, which lends to its durability.\" — Business Insider. \"Sijo's French Linen is stone-washed for softness and free from chemicals or fabric softeners, unlike some linen brands, which can rely on chemicals to soften them up quickly.\" — Domino 100% Natural Linen: Made by 100% French Linen sourced in small batches from the Normandy region of France, an area known for producing some of the best linen in the world. The natural linen sheet is recyclable, sustainable and eco-friendly. Hypoallergenic organic sheets is not bleached or dyed so that the sheet is friendly for allergies. Skin-friendly Fabric: The fabric is Oeko-Tex Standard 100 certified, indicating no harmful dyes or chemicals are used during the manufacturing process. Because of preshrunk and stonewashed, it’s more durable than cotton with a higher density and yet still wonderfully soft to the touch. The fabric is breathable and moisture-wicking so that you can get quality sleep all night. Softer After Every Wash: The easiest way to keep your new French Linen Sheets fresh is by hand wash, or machine wash with cold water. Completely rinse any soap or detergent from your French Linen to keep them incredibly soft. Gentle machine wash, tumble dry on low steam and dry cleaned if preferred. Linen fabric will becomes softer after every wash. It also does not pill as fast at cotton. 8 Loops: Our duvet cover has 8 corner and side loops instead of the traditional 4 loops. Seal off your comforter easily with our beautiful coconut shell buttons. Full/Queen 90\"x90\". King/Cal King 106\"x90\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616MeyBBFVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sijo","source_asin":"B09TFLQ57S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-329763","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TFLQ57S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TFLQ57S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":329764,"name":"Banishing Incense 1.25 oz Hoodoo Voodoo Wicca Pagan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Aekx-LrHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Banishing Salts are made with Dead Sea Salt, lemon, basil, wormword and an array of other herbs and essential oils. They come in a 8 oz container. PLEASE NOTE* Banishing Incense is not self-igniting. It is meant to be burnt over a charcoal disc. Banishing Incense can be used in a wide variety of ways. Burn a little in every corner of your home to help banish negative energy. Remember to open your windows so the old energy actually leaves your home! Burn some by your front door to keep negative energy from coming in. Burn some on your altar while burning a black candle to help you banish specific people or situations. Place a little incense in a bowl of water with Kosher salt and keep it in the center of your home or under your bed. Steep some in some hot water and use it as a floor wash. You can even use this blend as a spiritual bath by placing some in a stocking or muslin bag and putting it in your bath water while you bathe. You may simply burn some while reading Psalm 91 or 23. Sold as a Curio. For external use only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Aekx-LrHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Art of the Root","source_asin":"B00KUH33ES","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-329764","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KUH33ES","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KUH33ES","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
