window.products.push({"id":329835,"name":"MaMahome Food Storage Containers Set, Kitchen Pantry Organization and Storage Set for Cereal, Spaghetti, Noodles, Pasta & Flour Plastic Canisters Set ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AWU4E+9qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Kitchen Food Storage Containers - We have taken meticulous care to ensure that the containers you receive will last for years to come. Unlike most sellers which have lids that easily break with use, our containers come with new and improved lids which are made up of high impact resistant and durable ABS plastic which means you don’t need to worry about the Lids breaking. Additionally the lid-lock mechanism ensures maximum freshness and prolonged food storage.by creating 100% air-tightness. MaMahone Air-Tight Food Storage Containers Best Bang for Your buck - We provide a higher total storing capacity unlike most others on Amazon. Includes 1 large container (8.0 cups /1.9 liters), 2 medium containers (5.1 cups /1.2 liters), 2 small containers (3.4 cups /0.8 liter), 2 mini containers (2.1 cups /0.5 liters). These air tight containers come in a wide variety of shapes and sizes for all your storage needs. Superior Bundle Containers for Food - Your complete bundle comes with 7 BPA-free premium food-storage canisters, reusable chalkboard labels allowing you to organize your pantry like never before. This set comes in a beautiful box which makes it an ideal gift for any family. Nobody else in the market provides more value to you than us Verstile Storage Contianers - many great uses: These air-tight food-safe keepers are not only ideal for storing dry foods such as flour, sugar, rice, grain, cereals, nuts, beans, snacks, pasta, spaghetti, noodles, coffee and tea and but they are also perfect for holding liquids such as water, juice, soup, and more. No need to worry about liquids spilling out, just push down the handle and let the airtight technology do it’s magic Air-tight Food Storage Container Set Space Saving Design - These durable square containers have been especially designed to minimize space, they are stackable and will easily fit into your refrigerator, freezer or cupboard which enables you to get the kitchen organized and frees up space in the pantry. These clear containers are also easy to clean, extremely user friendly and ready to use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AWU4E+9qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MaMahome","source_asin":"B08XM7ZX4F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-329835","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XM7ZX4F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XM7ZX4F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
