window.products.push({"id":329953,"name":"QwikDescaler+ Tankless Water Heater Flushing Kit and Descaling Solution, All-Inclusive Descaler Kit, Quickly Dissolves Scale, Lime, Rust and Other Wat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7169ajvB7GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"QUICKLY FLUSH FLOW PASSAGES: Use this descaler solution to rapidly improve efficiency and open flow passages of heaters and other tankless heat exchangers. Multipurpose cleaning supplies, flushes out water scale, lime, rust, and other mineral deposits. EFFECTIVE SOLUTION BUT ALSO VERY SAFE: QwikDescaler cleaner descaler for tankless water heater is not only extremely effective at flushing out unwanted build-up in your systems, but it’s very also safe. This tankless water heater flushing kit is safe to handle, non-corrosive, non-toxic, and biodegradable. It also gives off ZERO VOCs. IT’S EASY TO TELL WHEN YOU NEED TO ADD MORE: There’s no guesswork with the QwikDescaler+ tankless water heater descaler. If more descaling solution is needed, it will turn from red to yellow, so you’ll get visual confirmation to add more. EXTEND LIFE OF YOUR UNIT & REDUCE COSTS: Flushing your tankless water heater at least once a year is a great way to help extends its life. The water heater descaling solution in this tankless water heater flush kit will eliminate buildup that will erode the walls and increase energy costs. HIGH-QUALITY, AMERICAN PRODUCTS: At QwikProducts, we turn cutting-edge technology into top-of-the-line, cost-effective products for our customers. We’re proud to say that all of our products are researched, designed, and manufactured in the USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7169ajvB7GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QwikProducts","source_asin":"B073SB2G2P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-329953","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073SB2G2P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073SB2G2P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":329954,"name":"WETCAT Turkish Beach Towel - 100% Cotton Pestemal with Hand-Tied Tassels - Absorbent, Quick-Drying & Soft - Washer-Safe, Great for Travel - Stylish, E","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91s4sHCfEaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Super-Soft, Ultra-Absorbent and Undeniably Chic! Whether you’re at home or on the go, towels and blankets are must-haves. But thick, bulky material weighs down travel bags and dominates the storage space in your closet, leaving you with next to no room for other essentials. Discover the convenience of Turkish cotton with Wetcat’s Beach Towels! Made with 100% cotton, this lavish material is super-absorbent, yet amazingly quick-drying. Offering 2-in-1 convenience, you can use it as a towel, blanket or both! Available in both round (60”) and rectangular (39 x 71”) sizes, you can use it after a shower, by the pool or as a throw, sarong, wrap or cover up. Prefect for those who love to travel, our Turkish towels are thin and lightweight for transportation that’s truly hassle-free! From yoga class and picnics to family camping trips, you can use it almost anywhere. And because our Turkish towel doesn’t hold sand, it makes a great beach blanket! As an added bonus, it’s washer-safe on the delicate cycle. We suggest air drying for best results. Love our unique prints, vibrant colors and hand-tied tassels? It’s all thanks to Lucy the Cat, our world-class design specialist! Made with OEKO-TEX certified natural dyes, our towels are as safe for the earth as they are stylish. Why Choose Our Turkish Bath Towel? - Highly absorbent and quick-drying- Lightweight and great for travel- Safe in the washer on delicate- Stunning designs with colorful hand-tied tassels- Durable, eco-friendly design Try Today Risk-Free with Our Money Back Guarantee! *Stock is limited. Order today to ensure availability. Order Your Turkish Beach Blanket Now for Go-Anywhere Comfort!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91s4sHCfEaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WETCAT","source_asin":"B07GH6HBMT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-329954","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GH6HBMT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GH6HBMT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
