window.products.push({"id":329968,"name":"Microtex innovation- Decorative Pillows for Home with Stuffing Included, Set of 2 Soft Velvet Throw Pillows,16x16 Square Cushions Filled with 100% Pol","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XNL6RsLvS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Many times, choosing cushions can be as difficult as choosing the right outfit for an important event.  To create a pleasant atmosphere at home, various interior elements and accessories are used, some of which are beautiful decorative pillows that fill our home with an atmosphere of peace and warmth. That is why we should always keep in mind quality, good choice, and confidence. This is what our soft velvet decorative cushion offer, making any place feel like home. Microtex Fabric manufactures its luxurious accent pillows in the United States, a family-owned and operated textile business for the home décor market. We have over 30 years of experience, providing our customers with the best service and quality. We have found and produced a wide variety of different fabrics to suit every customer's look and feel. We strive to offer high-quality products and are on a mission to guarantee your satisfaction. The cushions are made with the best quality fabric.  The velvet fabric used to make the cushions is suitable for pets and children. It has light and comfortable fibers and enhances breathability to provide you with comfort while using these soft pillows for your sofa and the peace of mind that you won't suffer from any allergies. We have more than 10 different designs and colors. This allows all our customers to choose the right cushions according to their interests and tastes. Maintenance Tips To collect dust, gently vacuum the cover, then gently pat it with a damp cloth well wrung out. Use baby wipes to remove small marks, with a light rubbing and twisting motion. To restore decorative pillows, use a medium bristle brush or lint brush. Use a lint roller to remove pet hair.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XNL6RsLvS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Microtex innovation","source_asin":"B08VFBF8JN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-329968","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VFBF8JN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VFBF8JN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
